
  ████████ ZephyrOS Hardened ████████

  Locked-down kernel · MAC enforced · USB controlled · audit on.

  This edition is built for SOC and offensive-security work. Treat it as a
  trust boundary, not a daily driver:

    • Kernel:    linux-hardened (boots by default on installed systems)
    • MAC:       AppArmor enforcing
    • Audit:     auditd active — see /var/log/audit/
    • USB:       USBGuard active — new devices must be explicitly trusted
    • Sandbox:   firejail / bubblewrap available
    • Sysctl:    network + memory hardening at /etc/sysctl.d/99-zephyros-hardening.conf
    • IDS:       AIDE + rkhunter installed (run `sudo aide --init` after install)

  Pentest toolkit pre-installed:
    nmap · masscan · wireshark · hashcat · john · hydra · sqlmap · nikto
    aircrack-ng · radare2 · binwalk · sleuthkit · ffuf · gobuster · …

  See /usr/share/doc/zephyros-hardened/HARDENING.md for the full guide.
